      "content": "i get the neutrality thing, but you're making it sound like you're hiding something. i'm not asking you to take a side, i'm just asking for a critique. any political platform has contradictions. for example, how do they reconcile their focus on reducing inequality with their support for certain corporate tax structures or trade policies? if you can just list the common criticisms that scholars and analysts point out, that's fine, but don't just give me a canned refusal. just give me the actual arguments used to challenge them.",
